      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Given your ongoing stomach issues and taking omeprazole, it's safest to consult your dentist or a healthcare professional before taking ibuprofen. Both NSAIDs like ibuprofen and Advil contain ingredients that can sometimes irritate the stomach. They can advise you on whether it is safe to combine these medications or suggest a different pain reliever for your toothache. Please seek professional medical advice to manage your pain safely.",
      "source": "target",
